      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `755868f4d1e8d41b986569223aee4ee29102fe1343e47b024c1e79147413985f--personal-crime-tables-13-to-19a-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2016-17\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 16 of 16\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | f7c73ef753c1ca28f35c0e7e6d2ec37a27336f2c06cb7bee7eeb4c2788a56141 | missing |\n| \"Table 13\" | 9ea91ac839cc5484d12433dbf84de122a6c597912be59f75590cfafa29a1188e | missing |\n| \"Table 13a\" | 7993331d146a9e8bf7edb782aff7ddc5608e0f0a02afbce819739b8fa0b4a87c | missing |\n| \"Table 14\" | 4d162b27fd2dd8a160a2bab8468518e6c4a71d2aab7a5efc207453ce77ec1de1 | missing |\n| \"Table 14a\" | 43f18be957dbed9af0b7fb69c2b9694f01a31630670f781888deadf2d372dd69 | missing |\n| \"Table 15\" | 518048997eba5823492d250eec8b02325495687185f6c720a122ec2cca5b69e6 | missing |\n| \"Table 15a\" | 949b7f95e81e9f5726339d46d7dd9d90e9f181be83d5a36046a8e27b2ed35d19 | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | b918fa3ff5d735588d9e8461a6f4dd6d5da141c154d89e0c1ab1cb0771b59bfd | missing |\n| \"Table 16a\" | 50536f441a10b7a15cc2e3e263a30dc9bdc2871120e14a0321c2db20b215ddef | missing |\n| \"Table 17\" | 9ccdc9624076a07a04186847a7e59c69289225a4245112bc3b2e57f7c4eb8ffd | missing |\n| \"Table 17a\" | 9ad760a7055270f5fa13c89c692b7127d1c62b11f5407720abf79ffd17a51b1e | missing |\n| \"Table 18\" | b46acf360ed5e847c1c22b84c2603f1fb58bfc6f95d2dec40fe95bd4687a14a5 | missing |\n| \"Table 18a\" | e23c3f977f5e450080a2395846ba0e34e6200f3b9bdb27a796bc4886bca261f9 | missing |\n| \"Table 19\" | 5cbbcf744bc684a02b8cb90b057fa5486464789b0854c90ecf1a8297290c9db1 | missing |\n| \"Table 19a\" | 36e510383709e24d25e2dab2abd23b45f840e85d9bf187df086a2e9cbc394289 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | ba13cdc3ea5d4e7bbd578462ac9b77e1913bda48bfed6938341cd1e47e04e26c | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
